{"slug":"15444-daalimbeya-ruchi","title":"ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಯ ರುಚಿ","titleEn":"Daalimbeya Ruchi","level":"3","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":15444,"authors":["Jayashree Deshpande"],"illustrators":["Srikrishna Kedilaya"],"translators":[],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2004","copyrightNotice":"'Daalimbeya Ruchi' has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org","attributionLine":"ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಯ ರುಚಿ (Kannada), written by Jayashree Deshpande, illustrated by Srikrishna Kedilaya, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2004) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Boy and man walking in the farm","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":3,"title":"Farm with hut","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":4,"title":"Farmer at work","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":5,"title":"Boy walking in a stream","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":6,"title":"View of a fenced farm","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":7,"title":"Boy talking to man","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":8,"title":"Man talking to boy","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":9,"title":"Orchard with trees","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":10,"title":"Boy and man at a farm","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":11,"title":"Pomegranate trees","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":12,"title":"View of an orchard with trees","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":13,"title":"Man and boy talking","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":14,"title":"Farmer with pomegranate tree","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":15,"title":"Boy n front of papaya tree","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":16,"title":"Pomegranate fruit","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":17,"title":"Boy pointing","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":18,"title":"Man telling boy a story","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":19,"title":"Monkey eating pomegranate","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":20,"title":"Man holding pomegranate seeds","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":21,"title":"Boy eating","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":22,"title":"Boy watching monkey on tree","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":23,"title":"Boy and man walking in the farm (black and white)","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":24,"title":"Boy eating pomegranate and looking at pomegranate tree (black and white)","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"},{"page":28,"title":"Boy watching monkey on tree","illustrator":"Srikrishna Kedilaya","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2004"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p01.jpg","width":639,"height":459},"text":[]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p02.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ರಾಜು ತನ್ನ ಅಜ್ಜನ ಜೊತೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸಾಯಂಕಾಲದ ಸಮಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಊರ ಹೊರಗಿನ ತೋಟಕ್ಕೆ ತಿರುಗಾಡುತ್ತ ಹೋದನು.","ತೋಟವು ಬಹಳ ದೂರವಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ. ಸಂಜೆಯ ಸಮಯದ ತಂಗಾಳಿ ಬೀಸುತ್ತಿತ್ತು.","ದಾರಿಯ ಎಡಬಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬೇರೆ ಬೇರೆವಿಧವಾದ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಸಿದ್ದ ಅನೇಕ ಗದ್ದೆಗಳು ಹೊಲಗಳು ರಾಜುವಿಗೆ ಕಾಣಿಸಿದುವು.","ಇನ್ನು ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಮುಂದೆ ಹೋದಾಗ ಹಣ್ಣಿನ ತೋಟವು ಬಂದಿತು. ಅಜ್ಜ ರಾಜುವಿನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಆ ತೋಟದೊಳಗೆ ನಡೆದರು. ಅಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಮರಗಳು ಇದ್ದುವು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p04.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":[]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p05.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":[]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p06.jpg","width":639,"height":459},"text":[]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p07.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":[]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p08.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಆ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಮರಗಳೂ ಸಾಕಷ್ಟು ನೀರನ್ನು ಉಂಡು, ಗೊಬ್ಬರವನ್ನು ಪಡೆದು ಹುಲುಸಾಗಿ, ದಪ್ಪವಾಗಿ ಬೆಳೆದಿದ್ದವು. ಪೇರಲ, ಚಕ್ಕೋತದ ಮರಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಚಿಕ್ಕ-ದೊಡ್ಡ ಅನೇಕ ಕಾಯಿಗಳು ಬಿಟ್ಟುಬಿಟ್ಟಿದ್ದವು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p09.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":[]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p10.jpg","width":639,"height":459},"text":[]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p11.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":[]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p12.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ಓ... ಇದು ನನ್ನ ಪ್ರೀತಿಯ ಹಣ್ಣು,” ಎಂದು ಅವನು ಹೇಳಿದಾಗ ಅಜ್ಜ, “ಹೌದೆ? ಹಾಗಾದರೆ ನೀನು ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಬೇಕಾದರೂ ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಗಳನ್ನು ತಿನ್ನಬಹುದು, ಎಂದರು. ಮರದಲ್ಲಿ ದಪ್ಪವಾಗಿ ಬೆಳೆದು ತೂಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದ ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಕೆಲವನ್ನು ಕೊಯ್ದು ತೆಗೆದು, ತೊಳೆದು ರಾಜುವಿಗೆ ತೋರಿಸಿದರು ಅಜ್ಜ."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p13.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ನಮ್ಮ ದೇಶಕ್ಕೆ ಬಂದು ಇಳಿಯಿತು. ಇಲ್ಲಿನವರಿಗೆ ಈ ಹಣ್ಣಿನ ರುಚಿ","ತುಂಬಾ ಹಿಡಿಸಿದ್ದರಿಂದ ಮುಂದೆ ನಮ್ಮ ದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿಯೂ ಅದನ್ನು","ಬೆಳೆಯಲು ಆರಂಭವಾಯಿತು,” ಎಂದರು."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":[]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p15.jpg","width":639,"height":459},"text":[]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p16.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಯನ್ನು ಮಧ್ಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಕತ್ತರಿಸಿದಾಗ ಒಳಗೆಲ್ಲ ಮುತ್ತುಗಳನ್ನು ಜೋಡಿಸಿದಂತೆ ಸಾಲು ಸಾಲಾಗಿ ಕೆಂಪು ಬಣ್ಣದ ಕಾಳುಗಳು ತುಂಬಿಕೊಂಡಿದ್ದವು. ಅವುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಸಿಹಿಯಾದ, ಮಧುರವಾದ ರಸವು ತುಂಬಿತ್ತು. ಅದರಿಂದಾಗಿ ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಯ ಒಳಭಾಗವು ಹೊಳೆಯುತ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p17.jpg","width":639,"height":690},"text":["“ಈ ಹಣ್ಣಿನ ಮೇಲೆ ಕೋತಿಗಳಿಗೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಪ್ರೀತಿ,” ಅಜ್ಜ ಹೇಳಿದರು.","“ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ತೋಟದೊಳಗೆ ನುಗ್ಗಿದಾಗ ಕೋತಿಗಳು ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಗಳನ್ನು ಕಚ್ಚಿ ತಿಂದು ಉಳಿದ ಭಾಗವನ್ನು ಕೆಳಗೆ ಹಾಕಿ ಬಿಡುತ್ತವೆ,” ಎಂದರು."]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p18.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಜೊತೆಗೆ ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದ ಅರ್ಧ ತಿಂದಿದ್ದ ಕಾಯಿಗಳನ್ನು ತೋರಿಸಿದರು. ಅದನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ ರಾಜುವಿಗೆ ನಗೆ ಬಂದಿತು."]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p19.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅಜ್ಜ, “ತೆಗೆದುಕೋ, ಈ ದಾಳಿಂಬೆಯ ಕಾಳುಗಳನ್ನು ತಿನ್ನು. ಇದು ಆರೋಗ್ಯಕ್ಕೆ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು. ನಿನಗೆ ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ಹಸಿವೆ ಆಗುವಂತೆ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ,” ಎಂದರು."]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p20.jpg","width":639,"height":690},"text":[]},{"n":21,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p21.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":[]},{"n":22,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p22.jpg","width":639,"height":690},"text":["ಈ ಚಿತ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಬಣ್ಣ ತುಂಬಿರಿ"]},{"n":23,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/15444-daalimbeya-ruchi/p23.jpg","width":639,"height":690},"text":["ಈ ಚಿತ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಬಣ್ಣ ತುಂಬಿರಿ"]}],"wordCount":187}